{"schemaVersion":1,"key":"intermediate/agents-in-practice","track":"everyone","lang":"en","dir":"ltr","title":"Agents in Practice","words":1085,"objectives":{"lang":"en","items":["Say why you learn to work with an agent by using one","Know which course to take first, and which one is optional","Tell Claude Cowork apart from Claude Duet"]},"translatedObjectives":null,"prerequisites":[{"key":"intermediate/coding-agents","number":11,"title":"Code Agents","drawn":true,"track":"everyone","lang":"en"}],"previous":{"key":"intermediate/coding-agents","number":11,"title":"Code Agents","drawn":true,"track":"everyone","lang":"en"},"next":{"key":"intermediate/harness-engineering","number":13,"title":"Harness Engineering","drawn":true,"track":"everyone","lang":"en"},"toc":[{"id":"why-take-these-courses","text":"Why Take These Courses","depth":2},{"id":"claude-101","text":"Claude 101","depth":2},{"id":"claude-code-101-optional","text":"Claude Code 101 (Optional)","depth":2},{"id":"introduction-to-claude-cowork","text":"Introduction to Claude Cowork","depth":2},{"id":"summary","text":"Summary","depth":2},{"id":"references","text":"References","depth":2},{"id":"-articles","text":"📄 Articles","depth":3}],"body":[{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"An AI agent is an AI that does not only answer you. It also does things for you: it opens files, writes documents, searches the web and uses your apps, one step after another, until a job is done. You can read about agents for a long time. But the fastest way to understand them is to give one a real job and watch what it does."}],"lead":true},{"type":"callout","kind":"warning","title":[{"type":"strong","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"🛑 STOP. Take the courses first, then come back."}]}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Reading this page is not the lesson. It points you to three free courses, and taking them is the lesson. Two are required and take about five hours in total: Claude 101 and Introduction to Claude Cowork, about two and a half hours each. The third, Claude Code 101, is optional and adds about one and a half hours."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"⏱️ About five hours required · ➕ About one and a half hours optional"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan the time, take the courses in the order below, and return to this page when you are done."}]}],"action":null},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"why-take-these-courses","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Why Take These Courses"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"When you read about an agent, everything goes well. When you work with one, it sometimes misunderstands you or takes a wrong turn. Then you have to notice it and guide it back. That is the real skill, and only practice teaches it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"The three courses below are free and short, and you learn by doing. The company that makes the tools wrote them, and each one ends with a short quiz and a badge."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"All three use "},{"type":"strong","inlines":[{"type":"logo","src":"course-images/intermediate/logos/claude.svg","alt":"","mono":false},{"type":"text","text":"Claude"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the AI assistant made by Anthropic. At the time of writing, we think it is the most capable assistant for this kind of work, the most trusted, and the one with the most features. What you learn with it also helps you with other AI assistants."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"claude-101","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude 101"}]},{"type":"callout","kind":"important","title":[{"type":"strong","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"🛑 Course 1 of 3: stop here and take it now"}]}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"strong","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude 101"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Claude for everyday work: your first conversation, better answers, and projects that keep one job together."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"⏱️ About two and a half hours · ✅ Required · 🏅 Free course, with a quiz and a badge"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Open the course, finish it, then come back to this page and carry on."}]}],"action":{"target":{"kind":"external","url":"https://academy.claude.com/courses/claude-101"},"inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Open Claude 101"}]}},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"link","target":{"kind":"external","url":"https://academy.claude.com/courses/claude-101"},"inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude 101"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is where everyone should start. It shows you how to use Claude in your daily work: your first conversation, how to ask so that you get better answers, and how to keep the documents and instructions for one piece of work together in a project. It also shows how Claude connects to tools you already use."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"You need a Claude account. The free plan is enough, and you need no experience with AI. Two parts, Cowork and Research, need a paid plan if you want to try them yourself. It takes about two and a half hours."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"claude-code-101-optional","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude Code 101 (Optional)"}]},{"type":"callout","kind":"note","title":[{"type":"strong","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"💡 Course 2 of 3: optional, take it if you are curious"}]}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"strong","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude Code 101"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the coding agent for developers, which people with no coding skill also use to build small tools."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"⏱️ About one and a half hours · ➕ Optional · 🏅 Free course, with a quiz and a badge"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"If you take it, finish it, then come back to this page and carry on. If you skip it, go to the next course."}]}],"action":{"target":{"kind":"external","url":"https://academy.claude.com/courses/claude-code-101"},"inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Open Claude Code 101"}]}},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"link","target":{"kind":"external","url":"https://academy.claude.com/courses/claude-code-101"},"inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude Code 101"}]},{"type":"text","text":" teaches Claude Code. Claude Code is an agent that you talk to in a text window called a terminal. It was made for writing software, and this course is written for developers."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"That is why this course is optional if you are not an engineer. Still, we think it is worth a look. You can describe what you want in plain words, and Claude Code writes the code and runs it for you. People who know nothing about coding use it to build small tools, clean up spreadsheets and automate boring tasks. The course itself expects you to know a code editor and the command line a little. It needs a paid Claude plan or an API key."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"introduction-to-claude-cowork","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Introduction to Claude Cowork"}]},{"type":"callout","kind":"important","title":[{"type":"strong","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"🛑 Course 3 of 3: stop here and take it now"}]}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"strong","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Introduction to Claude Cowork"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Claude working with the files, folders and apps on your computer."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"⏱️ About two and a half hours · ✅ Required · 🏅 Free course, with a quiz and a badge"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Open the course, finish it, then come back to this page for the summary."}]}],"action":{"target":{"kind":"external","url":"https://academy.claude.com/courses/introduction-to-claude-cowork"},"inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Open Introduction to Claude Cowork"}]}},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"If you do not write code, take this course after Claude 101. "},{"type":"strong","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude Cowork"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is Claude working directly with the files, folders and apps on your computer. It is part of the normal Claude app. You start the work: you give it a goal, such as \"sort these invoices into folders and make me a summary\". Claude makes a plan, does the steps, and you can guide it along the way. At the end you get a real result, such as a report, a spreadsheet or a tidy folder."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"link","target":{"kind":"external","url":"https://academy.claude.com/courses/introduction-to-claude-cowork"},"inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Introduction to Claude Cowork"}]},{"type":"text","text":" teaches you to hand it work like this. It also shows Claude inside Chrome, Word, Excel, PowerPoint and Outlook, and how to check its work before you trust it. You do not need to code. You need a paid Claude plan, and the Claude desktop app for the lessons that work with folders on your computer. It takes about two and a half hours."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"(Do not confuse Cowork with "},{"type":"strong","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude Duet"}]},{"type":"text","text":". With Cowork, you start the work. With Duet, Claude starts it: Duet keeps an eye on the apps you connect, does work in the background, and comes to you with a short summary every morning.)"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"summary","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Summary"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"You learn to work with an AI agent by working with one. Start with Claude 101. Then take Introduction to Claude Cowork, which teaches an agent that works with your files and apps. Claude Code 101 is optional for you. The course is written for developers, but the tool it teaches, Claude Code, can build small things for people who do not code."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"references","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"References"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"-articles","inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"📄 Articles"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"link","target":{"kind":"external","url":"https://academy.claude.com/courses/claude-101"},"inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude 101"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Claude for everyday work"}]}]},{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"link","target":{"kind":"external","url":"https://academy.claude.com/courses/claude-code-101"},"inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude Code 101"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the coding agent, for developers and the curious"}]}]},{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","inlines":[{"type":"link","target":{"kind":"external","url":"https://academy.claude.com/courses/introduction-to-claude-cowork"},"inlines":[{"type":"text","text":"Introduction to Claude Cowork"}]},{"type":"text","text":": handing work on files and apps to Claude"}]}]}]}],"draft":null,"quiz":null}